    "narrative": "The Austin Waves enter today\u2019s slate with a clear objective: exploit the favorable pitching matchups for our middle infield and outfield anchors. **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** (73.66) and **Jackson Merrill** (70.23) headline our production today, buoyed by plus-matchups against Burnes and Alcantara respectively. **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** receives a massive 19% boost from the opposing SP skill, paired with a favorable platoon split. Meanwhile, **Jackson Merrill** remains our primary engine for stolen base production; despite a modest park factor, his 13% SP skill bump and consistent usage in the five-hole make him a high-floor start. **Gunnar Henderson** (69.20) presents a fascinating case\u2014despite a daunting 2.32 xERA from Misiorowski, **Gunnar Henderson** maintains a robust score due to a significant 16% park factor advantage and his elite-tier pedigree, demonstrating that we aren't afraid to start stars even in sub-optimal pitching environments.\n\nEfficiency is our priority as we approach the final stretch of the season. The most difficult decision today was leaving **Josh Jung** (41.97) on the bench. He was the most viable alternative, but he failed to clear the threshold against Miles due to the lack of a platoon edge and a projected efficiency deficit compared to **Coby Mayo** and **Nasim Nunez**. We are also navigating a challenging matchup for **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** (48.20), whose score has been suppressed by the presence of deGrom on the mound; however, his high base projection keeps him in the utility slot. We remain cautious of the volatility surrounding **Drake Baldwin** (55.95) and **Sam Antonacci** (62.92) at the top of the order; while their leadoff status is a net positive for runs, their output relies heavily on getting on base early against Brown and Melton. Finally, we continue to monitor the status of **Kyle Tucker**, **Luis Robert Jr.**, and **Andy Pages**, whose absence from the starting lineup\u2014due to rest or injury\u2014remains a persistent drag on our overall offensive ceiling.",
